"ASML","ASMXF","CAMT","DINRF","KLAC","LRCX","NVMI","TELWY","VECO"],"beta":1.58,"beta_5y":1.58,"kd":4.5,"tax":21,"growth_10y":[5.4,4.9,4.4,4,3.8,3.5,3.2,2.9,2.6,2.2],"g1":5.4,"g2":3.5,"g":2.25,"wacc":10.9,"ev":9354.3,"fmp_official_ev":9354.3,"dcf_model_ev":3350.3,"ev_to_ebitda":37.7,"debt_to_ebitda":5.93,"net_debt_to_ebitda":-1.65,"f_score":6,"f_score_breakdown":[{"id":1,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"資產回報率 ROA > 0","passed":1,"detail":"當期 ROA = 3.6%"},{"id":2,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"營業現金流 CFO > 0","passed":1,"detail":"自由現金流 = $252M"},{"id":3,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"資產回報率持續擴張 (ΔROA > 0)","passed":0,"detail":"回報率穩步領先同業基準"},{"id":4,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"應計利潤品質高 (CFO > 淨利潤)","passed":1,"detail":"真實現金流充沛，無虛報帳面獲利"},{"id":5,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"財務槓桿未惡化 (ΔLeverage ≤ 0)","passed":1,"detail":"總負債資產比率 = 48.0%"},{"id":6,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"短期流動性安全 (ΔLiquidity > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"流動比率 = 9.73"},{"id":7,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"股本未遭稀釋 (ΔShares ≤ 0)","passed":1,"detail":"未大幅增發新股割韭菜"},{"id":8,"category":"營運效率","desc":"毛利率擴張 (ΔMargin > 0)","passed":0,"detail":"產品定價權增強，毛利結構健康"},{"id":9,"category":"營運效率","desc":"資產週轉率提升 (ΔTurnover > 0)","passed":0,"detail":"每單位資產產出效益改善"}],"fair_val":76.63,"default_fair_val":76.63,"premium_pct":159.7,"is_undervalued":false,"pe_trailing":73.6,"pe_forward":64.8,"pb_trailing":5.1,"pb_forward":4.6,"div_yield":0,"ps_ratio":9.7,"fcf_to_ev":2.7,"fcf_to_mcap":2.59,"liab_to_assets":48,"cash_to_assets":50.9,"current_ratio":9.73,"roe":6.9,"roa":3.6,"moat":{"ticker":"ONTO","period":"2026Q2","m1_brand_pricing":{"score":5,"comment_zh":"Onto Innovation 在半導體設備領域的品牌影響力尚屬穩固，但定價權並非其核心優勢。公司產品線涵蓋製程控制、檢測與良率提升解決方案，在特定細分市場具有一定技術領先性，能支持其獲取合理的利潤率。然而，與頂級半導體設備巨頭相比，其品牌溢價能力和獨立定價能力仍有提升空間。客戶黏性主要來自於技術整合與服務，而非單純的品牌忠誠度。","comment_en":"Onto Innovation possesses a solid brand presence within the semiconductor equipment sector, though pricing power is not its primary strength. The company's product lines, covering process control, inspection, and yield enhancement solutions, offer technological leadership in specific niches, enabling reasonable profit margins. However, compared to top-tier semiconductor equipment giants, its brand premium and independent pricing capabilities have room for improvement. Customer stickiness stems more from technological integration and service rather than pure brand loyalty."},"m2_patents_regulatory":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"Onto Innovation 在半導體製程控制和檢測技術方面擁有重要的專利組合，這構成了其重要的競爭壁壘。這些專利保護了其獨特的技術解決方案，尤其是在先進封裝和晶圓製造領域。雖然半導體產業的監管環境相對寬鬆，但技術專利是公司維持技術領先地位和防止競爭對手輕易模仿的關鍵。其專利布局有助於在特定技術節點上提供差異化產品和服務。","comment_en":"Onto Innovation holds a significant patent portfolio in semiconductor process control and inspection technologies, forming a crucial competitive barrier. These patents protect its unique technological solutions, particularly in advanced packaging and wafer manufacturing. While the semiconductor industry's regulatory environment is relatively open, technological patents are key for the company to maintain its technological edge and prevent easy imitation by competitors. Its patent strategy aids in offering differentiated products and services at specific technology nodes."},"m3_high_switching_costs":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"半導體設備的轉換成本對 Onto Innovation 而言相當高。一旦客戶將其設備整合到複雜的生產線中，並進行了大量的製程優化和驗證，更換供應商將涉及巨大的時間、金錢和風險成本。這不僅包括設備本身的採購和安裝，更重要的是重新校準、驗證和確保良率的過程。這種深度整合和長期合作關係，為公司創造了顯著的客戶黏性。","comment_en":"Switching costs for semiconductor equipment are considerably high for Onto Innovation. Once customers integrate its equipment into complex production lines and conduct extensive process optimization and validation, changing suppliers incurs substantial costs in time, money, and risk. This includes not only the procurement and installation of the equipment itself but, more importantly, the process of recalibration, revalidation, and ensuring yield. This deep integration and long-term partnership create significant customer stickiness for the company."},"m4_network_effects":{"score":2,"comment_zh":"Onto Innovation 的業務模式主要基於其技術和產品的優越性，而非網絡效應。其產品的價值主要體現在為單一客戶提供解決方案，而非通過用戶間的互動來增強價值。雖然行業內存在信息交流和標準制定，但這並未直接轉化為公司產品的網絡效應壁壘。因此，在這一維度上，公司的護城河相對較弱。","comment_en":"Onto Innovation's business model primarily relies on the superiority of its technology and products, rather than network effects. The value of its offerings is mainly derived from providing solutions to individual customers, not from enhancing value through user interactions. While information exchange and standard-setting exist within the industry, this does not directly translate into network effect barriers for the company's products. Consequently, the company's moat is relatively weak in this dimension."},"m5_cost_advantage_scale":{"score":6,"comment_zh":"Onto Innovation 在半導體設備領域的規模經濟效應正在逐步顯現。隨著產量增加和研發投入的攤薄，公司在生產成本和研發效率上具有一定的優勢。其全球化的供應鏈和製造能力，使其能夠在與主要客戶的合作中提供更具競爭力的價格。然而，相較於行業內規模最大的幾家公司，其成本優勢仍有提升空間，尤其是在採購議價能力方面。","comment_en":"Economies of scale are gradually becoming apparent for Onto Innovation in the semiconductor equipment sector. With increased production volume and the amortization of R&D investments, the company benefits from certain advantages in production costs and R&D efficiency. Its globalized supply chain and manufacturing capabilities allow it to offer more competitive pricing in collaborations with major clients. However, compared to the largest players in the industry, its cost advantage still has room for improvement, particularly in terms of purchasing negotiation power."},"m6_unique_geography_assets":{"score":3,"comment_zh":"Onto Innovation 的業務遍及全球，服務於主要的半導體製造中心。然而，公司並未擁有獨特的地理資產或特許經營權，其競爭優勢主要建立在技術和服務之上，而非依賴特定的地理位置。雖然其全球佈局有助於貼近客戶，但這並不構成一個難以逾越的護城河。","comment_en":"Onto Innovation operates globally, serving major semiconductor manufacturing hubs. However, the company does not possess unique geographical assets or franchises; its competitive advantage is primarily built on technology and services, not reliance on specific locations. While its global presence helps it stay close to customers, this does not constitute an insurmountable moat."},"m7_operational_efficiency":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"Onto Innovation 在營運效率方面表現穩健，尤其是在產品開發、製造和客戶服務的整合上。公司持續優化其生產流程，並透過精準的製程控制和檢測技術，幫助客戶提高良率和生產效率，這本身就是一種營運效率的體現。其較高的自由現金流（FCF TTM）也印證了其良好的營運管理和盈利能力。","comment_en":"Onto Innovation demonstrates solid operational efficiency, particularly in the integration of product development, manufacturing, and customer service. The company continuously optimizes its production processes and assists clients in improving yield and production efficiency through precise process control and inspection technologies, which is a manifestation of operational efficiency itself. Its strong Free Cash Flow (FCF TTM) also attests to its sound operational management and profitability."},"m8_capital_allocation":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"Onto Innovation 的資本配置策略顯示出其對股東價值的關注。公司擁有健康的現金儲備和相對較低的負債水平，為其提供了靈活性。其自由現金流的產生能力，使其能夠在研發投入、潛在的戰略收購以及股東回報之間取得平衡。管理層在維持穩健財務狀況的同時，尋求能夠增長股東價值的機會。","comment_en":"Onto Innovation's capital allocation strategy reflects a focus on shareholder value. The company maintains healthy cash reserves and a relatively low debt level, providing it with flexibility. Its ability to generate free cash flow allows it to balance investments in R&D, potential strategic acquisitions, and shareholder returns. Management seeks opportunities to grow shareholder value while maintaining a sound financial position."},"m9_customer_retention":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"如 M3 所述，高昂的轉換成本是 Onto Innovation 客戶留存率的關鍵。一旦客戶將其設備深度整合到生產流程中，並依賴其提供的技術支持和良率提升方案，客戶流失的風險就相對較低。公司透過持續的技術創新和優質的客戶服務，進一步鞏固了與客戶的長期合作關係，確保了較高的客戶留存率。","comment_en":"As noted in M3, high switching costs are a key driver of Onto Innovation's customer retention rate. Once customers deeply integrate its equipment into their production processes and rely on its technical support and yield enhancement solutions, the risk of customer churn is relatively low. The company further solidifies long-term partnerships through continuous technological innovation and high-quality customer service, ensuring a high customer retention rate."},"m10_durability":{"score":6,"comment_zh":"Onto Innovation 的業務在半導體產業鏈中扮演著關鍵角色，其產品對於提高製程良率和產能至關重要，這賦予了其業務一定的持久性。然而，半導體產業技術迭代迅速，公司需要持續投入研發以應對技術變革和競爭壓力，這意味著其護城河的持久性需要不斷的維護和加強。其在先進封裝等領域的佈局，顯示了其適應行業趨勢的努力。","comment_en":"Onto Innovation's business plays a critical role in the semiconductor value chain, with its products being essential for improving process yields and production capacity, lending a degree of durability to its operations. However, the semiconductor industry is characterized by rapid technological iteration, requiring the company to continuously invest in R&D to address technological shifts and competitive pressures. This means the durability of its moat requires constant maintenance and strengthening. Its strategic positioning in areas like advanced packaging demonstrates its efforts to adapt to industry trends."},"overall_moat_verdict_zh":"Onto Innovation 在半導體設備領域展現了穩固的競爭優勢，尤其體現在高轉換成本（M3）和專利技術（M2）上，這構成了其主要的護城河。客戶一旦深度整合其設備，便難以輕易更換，保證了較高的客戶留存率（M9）。公司在營運效率（M7）和資本配置（M8）方面也表現出色，自由現金流充裕。然而，其品牌定價權（M1）和網絡效應（M4）相對較弱，規模成本（M5）和獨特資產（M6）的壁壘也非頂尖。總體而言，Onto Innovation 類似於一個擁有強大技術壁壘和客戶黏性的「收費橋」模式，其護城河的持久性依賴於持續的技術創新和對行業趨勢的適應能力。","overall_moat_verdict_en":"Onto Innovation exhibits a solid competitive advantage in the semiconductor equipment sector, primarily driven by high switching costs (M3) and patented technologies (M2), which form its main moat. Once customers deeply integrate its equipment, replacement becomes difficult, ensuring high customer retention (M9). The company also excels in operational efficiency (M7) and capital allocation (M8), generating ample free cash flow. However, its brand pricing power (M1) and network effects (M4) are relatively weaker, and barriers from cost advantages (M5) and unique assets (M6) are not top-tier. Overall, Onto Innovation operates akin to a 'toll bridge' model with strong technological barriers and customer stickiness. The durability of its moat relies on continuous technological innovation and its ability to adapt to industry trends.","evidenceHash":"d6e28ff15d8a7d2f313b5b31f6ed7517778f132536fa5c88910bbbfe02da06f1","assessmentPolicy":"us-buffett-moat-v3"},"ratingSources":{"moat":{"reason":null},"fScore":{"score":6,"checkedAt":null},"zScore":{"asOfDate":"2026-01-03","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":"z","zone":"superRobust","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-10-28T14:40:26.418Z","evidenceHash":"753447bf399b7d532296ddf449d31d2aa7d26129dfa1f3bbd4a82403205ddf77"},"mScore":{"asOfDate":"2026-01-03","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":null,"zone":"clean","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-10-28T14:40:26.418Z","evidenceHash":"753447bf399b7d532296ddf449d31d2aa7d26129dfa1f3bbd4a82403205ddf77"}},"fin_valuation":{"is_financial":false},"image":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/ONTO.png","logo":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/ONTO.png","website":"https://www.ontoinnovation.com","ceo":"Michael Plisinski","full_time_employees":"1867","description":"Onto Innovation Inc. is a global leader in designing, manufacturing, and supporting cutting-edge process control solutions. The company's diverse portfolio encompasses tools for macro defect inspection, 2D/3D optical metrology, and lithography systems, alongside sophisticated analytical software for process control. These offerings are crucial for optimizing manufacturing processes, enhancing yield, and facilitating device packaging and testing in various industries worldwide. Their solutions are delivered both as standalone systems for specialized functions—such as detecting large flaws, performing packaging lithography, evaluating probe cards, and measuring transparent and opaque thin films—and through an extensive suite of process control software. This software scales from individual tool management to enterprise-wide factory integration. Beyond hardware and software, Onto Innovation also provides essential spare parts and software licensing services. Their technology is vital to a broad spectrum of clients, including manufacturers of semiconductors, advanced packaging, silicon wafers, LEDs, VCSELs, MEMS, CMOS image sensors, power devices, RF filters, and data storage products, as well as those in various industrial and scientific fields. Originally established in 1940 as Rudolph Technologies, Inc., Onto Innovation Inc. maintains its headquarters in Wilmington, Massachusetts.","description_en":"Onto Innovation Inc. is a global leader in designing, manufacturing, and supporting cutting-edge process control solutions. The company's diverse portfolio encompasses tools for macro defect inspection, 2D/3D optical metrology, and lithography systems, alongside sophisticated analytical software for process control. These offerings are crucial for optimizing manufacturing processes, enhancing yield, and facilitating device packaging and testing in various industries worldwide. Their solutions are delivered both as standalone systems for specialized functions—such as detecting large flaws, performing packaging lithography, evaluating probe cards, and measuring transparent and opaque thin films—and through an extensive suite of process control software. This software scales from individual tool management to enterprise-wide factory integration. Beyond hardware and software, Onto Innovation also provides essential spare parts and software licensing services. Their technology is vital to a broad spectrum of clients, including manufacturers of semiconductors, advanced packaging, silicon wafers, LEDs, VCSELs, MEMS, CMOS image sensors, power devices, RF filters, and data storage products, as well as those in various industrial and scientific fields. Originally established in 1940 as Rudolph Technologies, Inc., Onto Innovation Inc. maintains its headquarters in Wilmington, Massachusetts.","description_zh":"**Onto Innovation Inc. (ONTO) 業務營運概述**\n\nOnto Innovation Inc. 為全球領先的製程控制解決方案設計、製造與支援商。公司產品組合多元，涵蓋巨觀缺陷檢測、二維/三維光學計量及微影系統，並輔以先進的製程控制分析軟體。這些解決方案旨在優化製造流程、提升良率，並支援全球各產業的晶圓測試與封裝環節。\n\n其產品以獨立系統或整合軟體套件形式提供。獨立系統專注於特定功能，例如偵測大尺寸缺陷、封裝微影、探針卡評估，以及透明與不透明薄膜量測。軟體套件則從單機工具管理延伸至企業級廠務整合。此外，公司亦提供關鍵零組件及軟體授權服務。\n\nOnto Innovation 的技術廣泛應用於半導體、先進封裝、矽晶圓、LED、VCSEL、MEMS、CMOS影像感測器、功率元件、RF濾波器、資料儲存產品等製造商，以及其他工業與科學領域客戶。","address":"16 Jonspin Road","city":"Wilmington","state":"MA","zip":"01887","country":"US","phone":"978 253 6200","full_address":"16 Jonspin Road, Wilmington, MA 01887, US","range_52w":"118.97-386.46","year_high":386.46,"year_low":118.97,"all_time_high":0,"all_time_low":118.97,"inst_ownership_pct":null,"insider_ownership_pct":null,"top_holders":[],"insider_trades":[{"date":"2026-10-01","name":"MILLER DAVID BRIAN","title":"director","is_buy":false,"action":"S-Sale","shares":2000,"price":300,"total_val":0.6},{"date":"2026-09-04","name":"ROBERTS BRIAN K","title":"officer: Chief Financial Officer","is_buy":null,"action":"F-InKind","shares":3239,"price":254.55,"total_val":0.82},{"date":"2026-09-04","name":"Chen Shirley","title":"officer: Senior Vice President of Custo","is_buy":null,"action":"F-InKind","shares":1516,"price":254.55,"total_val":0.39},{"date":"2026-09-04","name":"ROBERTS BRIAN K","title":"officer: Chief Financial Officer","is_buy":null,"action":"F-InKind","shares":3239,"price":254.55,"total_val":0.82},{"date":"2026-08-25","name":"Lynch Susan D","title":"director","is_buy":false,"action":"S-Sale","shares":1000,"price":302.3,"total_val":0.3},{"date":"2026-05-22","name":"Su May","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":761,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-05-22","name":"SEAMS CHRISTOPHER A","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":761,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-05-22","name":"SCHWARTZ STEPHEN S","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":761,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-05-22","name":"MILLER DAVID BRIAN","title":